};

export default Home;

Conclusion
Server Side Rendering with React and Next.js allows you to generate HTML on the server for better SEO and performance. The getServerSideProps function is a key feature of Next.js, enabling you to fetch data on the server and pass it as props to your components. By following this pattern, you can ensure that your React applications are fast and optimized for both users and search engines.

